+### ICC bot-only gunship pass
+
+After Marrowgar and Deathwhisper, an autonomous raid passes the vehicle battle
+to Deathbringer's Rise and starts the faction captain's Saurfang intro. All raid
+slots must resolve to living idle bots in the same copy, with no human-controlled
+player anywhere in the instance. Combat, transport, vehicle and teleport defer
+the pass. It retries after a wipe and stops moving anyone once Saurfang is done.
+
+The core requires gunship's persisted boss slot DONE to fight later bosses. This
+is a progression pass, not a kill: no encounter credit, achievement, victory spell
+or hull kill is issued. Loaded armories are re-locked synchronously; later loads
+retain their stock locks. Leeroy must exclude this unearned slot from kill reports.
+A fresh instance or its normal reset is needed to play gunship after this pass;
+the automatic pass never resets a saved instance. Mixed/human raids are unchanged.
